Authority boundary conclusion:

The walkthrough accurately explains that Hedgehog OS now has a role-boundary
skeleton for bounded actors. It does not make autonomous agents. It prevents
role confusion before Fractal Cell Runtime integration. Actors cannot
self-promote, cannot command sideways, cannot create FinalOutput, and cannot
bypass Root. Root remains final authority.
